<title>SPAIN: DNIB issues 10 bln pta 4-yr callable bond at 100.9.</title>
<headline>DNIB issues 10 bln pta 4-yr callable bond at 100.9.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>De nationale Investeringsbank (DNIB) is issuing a 10 billion peseta four-year callable bond, with a coupon at 5.49 percent, at 100.9, Banco de Negocio Argentaria said.</p>
<p>Banco de Negocio Argentaria is joint lead manager with Banco Urquijo and BNP.  </p>
<p>The bond will mature on September 3, 2001, and has a pay date on September 3. Minimum tranche is for 10,000 pta.</p>
<p>Total fees are one percent.</p>
<p>DNIB has a rating of AA3 by Moody and AA+ by Standard and Poor's.</p>
<p>The bond is callable by the issuers after the first year, on September 1 1998 at par.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
